{title: Dil Dhoondta Hai (Fast)}
{artist: Bhupinder Singh Madan Mohan Lata Mangeshkar}
{key: D#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#m]dil dhundata hai, [F#]phir wahi
[C#]fursat ke [D#m]raat din
[C#]baithe rahe [D#m]tasawwoor-ye-jana kiye huye
[A#]jaadon ki [G#]narma dhup [Fm]aur aangan [A#]me let kar
[G#]aankho pe [F#]khinch kar [G#]tere aanchal [D#m]ke saaye ko
[D#m]aundhe pade [C#]rahe kabhee [D#m]karawat liye huye
[A#]yaa [G#]gamreeyon kee [Fm]raat jo [A#]purawaiyan chale
[G#]thhandee [F#]safed chaadaro [G#]pe jaage [D#m]der tak
[D#m]taaron ko [C#]dekhate rahe chhat [D#m]par pade huye
[A#]barfeeli [G#]sardiyon me [Fm]kisi bhi [A#]pahaad par
[G#]waadi [F#]me gunjati [G#]huyi [D#m]khamoshiyan sune
[D#m]aankho me [C#]bheeege bhige se [D#m]lamhe liye huye
